===== Hardware mods =====

==== Soft reset ====
Connecting pin 7 (EN) with pin 4 (GND) of MP1583DN (U1 and U3, both next to the 12V DC connector) will disable these Step-Down converter.\\ U1 generates 5 volt and U3 generates 3 volt, it is sufficient to disable U3 to force a reset.\\
**WARNING:** You could damage your device by doing this, do it on your own risk.


